#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installing the &kde-sc;"
msgstr "Instaliranje &kde-sc;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can install the &kde-sc; on a variety of different platforms, ranging "
"from smartphones and tablets to computers running &Microsoft; &Windows;, "
"&MacOS;, &UNIX;, &BSD; or &Linux;. Binary packages are available for many "
"different platforms and distributions, or advanced users may build the "
"source code."
msgstr ""
"Možete instalirati &kde-sc; na mnogo različitih platformi, od pametnih "
"telefona i tableta do računara koji koriste &Microsoft; &Windows;, &MacOS;, "
"&UNIX;, &BSD; ili &Linux;. Binarni paketi su dostupni za mnogo različitih "
"platformi i distribucija, a napredni korisnici mogu napraviti izvorni kod."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installing Packages"
msgstr "Instaliranje paketa"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hundreds of developers worldwide have done a lot of work to make it easy to "
"install &kde; on a variety of different devices and platforms."
msgstr ""
"Stotine developera širom svijeta su učinili mnogo da olakšaju instaliranje "
"&kde; na mnogo različitih uređaja i platformi."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Linux;"
msgstr "&Linux;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Nearly every &Linux; distribution provides binary packages for individual "
"&kde-sc; applications and the &plasma-workspaces; as a whole."
msgstr ""
"Skoro svaka &Linux; distribucija posjeduje binarni paket za pojedinačne &kde-"
"sc; aplikacije i &plasma-workspaces; kao cjelinu."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To install an individual application, look for its name in your "
"distribution's package collection. To install one of the &plasma-"
"workspaces;, like &plasma-desktop;, look for a metapackage or package group, "
"typically <literal>kde-desktop</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Da instalirate pojedinačnu aplikaciju, potražite njeno ime u kolekciji "
"paketa vaše distribucije. Da instalirate jednu od &plasma-workspaces;, poput "
"&plasma-desktop;, tražite metapaket ili grupu paketa, najčešće <literal>kde-"
"desktop</literal>."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some core applications may be installed together with other core "
"applications in a combined package named after the &kde; package they are "
"provided in. For instance, &dolphin; might be found in the <literal>kde-"
"baseapps</literal> package."
msgstr ""
"Neke osnovne aplikacije mogu biti instalirane uz druge osnovne aplikacije u "
"kombiniranim paketima nazvanim po &kde; paketu u kojem su sadržani. Na "
"primjer, &dolphin; može biti pronadjen u <literal>kde-baseapps</literal> "
"paketu."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have trouble locating &kde; packages for your distribution, please "
"contact their support resources. Many distributions also have a team "
"dedicated to packaging &kde; that can provide assistance specific to &kde;"
msgstr ""
"Ako imate problema sa pronalaženjem &kde; paketa za vašu distribuciju, "
"molimo kontaktirajte njihove resurse za podršku. Također, mnoge distribucije "
"posjeduju tim posvećen pakovanju &kde; koji može pružiti pomoć specifičnu za "
"&kde;"

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Microsoft; &Windows;"
msgstr "&Microsoft; &Windows;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kde; on Windows Initiative provides binary packages of &kde-sc; "
"applications for &Microsoft; &Windows;. They also provide a special "
"installer application that permits you to install individual applications or "
"groups and all necessary dependencies easily."
msgstr ""
"Inicijativa &kde; na  Windows-u obezbjeđuje binarne pakete &kde-sc; "
"aplikacija za &Microsoft; &Windows;. Također obezbjeđuju i posebne "
"aplikaciju za instalacije koja vam dozvoljava da instalirate pojedinačne "
"aplikacije ili grupe aplikacija i sve potrebne dodatke."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on the initiative and to download the installer, visit "
"<ulink url=\"http://windows.kde.org/\">the KDE on Windows Initiative</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija o incijativi, i da downloadujete instaler, posjetite "
"<ulink url=\"http://windows.kde.org/\">KDE na inicijativu Windows-a</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "&MacOS;"
msgstr "&MacOS;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Individual &kde-sc; applications can be installed through several different "
"<quote>ports</quote> systems available for &MacOS;. Several different &kde; "
"applications also provide their own binary builds for &MacOS;."
msgstr ""
"Pojedinačne &kde-sc; aplikacije mogu biti instalirane na više različitih "
"sistema <quote>portova</quote> omogućenih za &MacOS;. Nekoliko različitih "
"&kde; aplikacija posjeduju i sopstveni binarni build za &MacOS;."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information, visit <ulink url=\"http://mac.kde.org/\">&kde; on "
"&MacOS;X</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija posjetite <ulink url=\"http://mac.kde.org/\">&kde; na "
"&MacOS;X</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "&BSD;"
msgstr "&BSD;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most &BSD; distributions allows you to install &kde-sc; applications and the "
"&plasma-workspaces; as a whole through their <quote>ports</quote> system."
msgstr ""
"Većina &BSD; distribucija vam dozvoljava &kde-sc; aplikacije i &plasma-"
"workspaces; u cjelini kroz sistem njihovih <quote>portova</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on installing ports, see your &BSD; distribution's "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija o instalaciji portova, pogledajte vašu &BSD; "
"distribucijsku dokumentaciju."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mobile Devices"
msgstr "Mobilni uređaji"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&plasma-active; is an exciting initiative to bring a new &kde; experience to "
"mobile devices like smartphones or tablets. Binary releases are provided for "
"several different devices."
msgstr ""
"&plasma-active; je uzbudljiva inicijativa da donese novo &kde; iskustvo na "
"mobilne uređaje poput pametnih telefona ili tableta. Binarni release-ovi su "
"dostupni za nekoliko različitih uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information, visit <ulink url=\"http://plasma-active.org/\">&plasma-"
"active;</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija posjetite <ulink url=\"http://plasma-active.org/"
"\">&plasma-active;</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Live Media"
msgstr "Live medij"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Several &Linux; and &BSD; distributions offer live media. This permits you "
"to try out the &plasma-workspaces; without installing anything to your "
"system. All you have to do insert a CD or connect a USB drive and boot from "
"it. If you like what you see, most offer an option to install it to your "
"hard drive."
msgstr ""
"Nekoliko &Linux; i &BSD; distribucija nudi live medij. Ovo vam omogućava da "
"isprobate &plasma-workspaces; bez instaliranja ičega na vaš sistem. Sve što "
"treba da uradite jeste da ubacite CD ili konektujete USB drive i boot-ate sa "
"njega. Ako vam se svidi što vidite, većina nudi opciju da to instalirate na "
"vaš hard disk."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/download/distributions.php\">a list "
"of distributions that offer the &kde-sc; on live media</ulink> on the &kde; "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Postoji <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/download/distributions.php\">lista "
"distribucija koje nude &kde-sc; na live medijima</ulink> na &kde; web "
"stranici."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Building from Source Code"
msgstr "Build-anje iz izvornog koda"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For detailed information on how to compile and install &kde; applications "
"see <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Getting_Started#Building_and_Running_KDE_Software_From_Source\"> Building "
"and Running &kde; Software From Source on &kde; TechBase</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za detaljne informacije o tome kako kompajlirati i instalirati &kde; "
"aplikacije vidi <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Getting_Started#Building_and_Running_KDE_Software_From_Source\"> Build-anje "
"i Pokretanje &kde; Softvera iz izvora na &kde; TechBase</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &kde; software uses <command>cmake</command> you should have no "
"trouble compiling it. Should you run into problems please report them to the "
"&kde; mailing lists."
msgstr ""
"Kako &kde; softver koristi <command>cmake</command> ne biste trebali imati "
"problema kompajlirajući ga. Ukoliko se pojave neki problemi, molimo "
"podnesite izvještaj o tome na &kde; mailing liste."
